		"description": "Comprehensive Postman test collection for SWYNEX Task 2: Backend API and Database for NalamCamp.\n\nDemonstrates full lifecycle:\n1. Organizer Login\n2. Create Camp Draft\n3. Add Counters / Services (General Medicine & Eye Consultation)\n4. Submit Camp for Review\n5. Reviewer Login\n6. Reviewer Approval with Official Verification Source\n7. Public Search (Area & Service Filters)\n8. Public Direct Camp Detail\n9. Resident Reserve Token (Pessimistic locking & Idempotency safe)\n10. Private Booking Lookup\n11. Volunteer Login\n12. Volunteer Check-in\n13. Duplicate Check-in Prevention (409 Conflict)\n14. Volunteer Walk-in Registration (Does not consume online quota)\n15. Attendance Summary\n16. Poster OCR Upload\n17. Poster Match & Verification\n18. Resident Cancel Booking (Capacity Released Once)\n19. Staff Logout",
